  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together coconut oil, shrimp stock, cayenne pepper, and salt.",
    "Add the scored fat, fresh cilantro, and garlic to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Add the shrimp to the bowl and toss until coated with the marinade.",
    "Wrap each shrimp in a piece of lotus-leaf and place on a baking sheet.",
    "Bake the shrimp for 8-10 minutes or until pink and cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, slice the avocado and set aside.",
    "To assemble the wrap, place a cooked shrimp in the center of a lotus-leaf wrap, followed by a slice of avocado and a drizzle of fresh lime juice.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
